# --- Arm vendor artifacts: NOT committed --------------------------------------
#
# Redistribution terms for the Arm MPS4 / Corstone SSE-320 FI101 distribution
# have not been established. Everything below is either Arm source or compiled
# from it, so it is excluded until the licence is checked.
#
# Excluding is cheap to undo -- delete the line and commit. Publishing first is
# not: removing a blob from a public repo needs history rewriting, and by then
# it may already be cloned, forked or cached.
#
# The artifacts still exist locally and are hash-recorded in
# build-env/BUILD_ENVIRONMENT.yaml, so provenance survives their absence here.

# Arm Selftest source distribution and the working tree derived from it
build-env/fi101-selftest-src.tgz
build-env/selftest-worktree.tgz

# Firmware images: compiled from Arm Selftest sources -> derivative works
*.BIN

# Arm-authored linker script and region headers (my overlay IS committed)
firmware/LinkScripts/lnk.ld.S
firmware/LinkScripts/lnk.sct
firmware/LinkScripts/region_defs.h
firmware/LinkScripts/region_limits.h

# Board platform binaries live in a separate archive and are never committed:
#   ~/Documents/Projects/personal/mps4_board_recovery/   (113 MB)

# --- internal handoff artifacts: NOT committed --------------------------------
